! Continuation of the 0.47 deg atmosphere phase on Stampede3 (2026-11-16),
! from the third try's last restart (out_dir real047_atm_debug2: 7500 steps,
! 201 s of model time at the top in 3 h, stopped by the wall limit, no NaN;
! cond_tau_fsat fixed the cold-slab crash). Same physics; only the restart,
! a new out_dir (new profile series), and the box every 100 steps.
! At the stop: dt 0.020 s, max Mach 11.7 and max |v_r| 414 km/s, both still
! rising over the last ~100 s (the place is not in the box: the job's stdout
! ends with a "max Mach: r/R lat lon z" line); the hottest box cell ~8 MK.
! Watch: max Mach / max |v_r| (log.txt columns 4, 5) levelling off, dt.
! The restart lives on $SCRATCH (10-day purge). For an 8 h job (~20000 steps):
!   sbatch -N 4 --ntasks-per-node 112 -t 08:00:00 tools/job.stampede3_spr4 runs/real047_atm_cont.nml
&cz3d
  grid_file = 'data/grid_atm20.dat', init_file = 'data/init_wind20_dip_m600.dat', n_r_cells = 560
  table_file = 'data/eos_table_wind.bin'
